OL,3,GNEWSAWhy does Paisley love the spooks
OL,4,Aand scares of Halloween so much?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll Hallow's Eve may still be over a
OL,7,Fweek away, but in Paisley ghoulish
OL,8,Fexcitement has already possessed many a
OL,9,Flocal.
OL,11,FCouncil officials claim the town has
OL,12,Fthe unofficial title of "Scotland's
OL,13,FHalloween capital", with the coming
OL,14,Fweekend seeing its popular two day
OL,15,FHalloween festival take place, complete
OL,16,Fwith a parade, street theatre and a
OL,17,Ffunfair.
OL,19,FThey say it is one of the biggest dates
OL,20,Fof the year for the area, with
OL,21,Fthousands of visitors expected and
OL,22,Fhundreds of performers lined up.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
