OL,3,GNEWSAWhy does Paisley love the spooks
OL,4,Aand scares of Halloween so much?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Paisley took the prize for
OL,7,FScotland's "Town of the Year" in 2025,
OL,8,Fevents like the Halloween celebration
OL,9,Fwas cited as one of the reasons why.
